  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Carrying Capacity Study and Tourism Destinations Planning on Coastal Areas of Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Under this framework contract, an assessment of carrying capacity for sustainable tourism activities will be carried out with focus on three main destinations of Tanzania: Mafia Island, Kilwa and Saadani National Park. The initial study will inform an inclusive destination planning process to be carried out at local level, in collaboration of all stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
